                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "943657a5-3347-372f-80a1-5a9e256f06b4",
                        "entry_id": "8e2ac80a-f607-33a0-9f78-4707a02e17ef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. человек, страдающий истерией, подверженный истерическим припадкам"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8871f8ed-dc25-4d3c-9e70-af06a416036a",
                                "sense_id": "943657a5-3347-372f-80a1-5a9e256f06b4",
                                "text": "Столь характерные для некоторых истериков страстные позы могли бы, быть может, быть объяснены очень просто, так же как странные крики, которые испускают подобные больные во время истерического припадка."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e70a91df-40e2-4684-92fd-6b2142c36070",
                                "sense_id": "943657a5-3347-372f-80a1-5a9e256f06b4",
                                "text": "Панька пожил с месяц, не больше, дома и забузил, забузил отчаянно, так как был истериком."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6afb224-9651-4a4a-8170-6303abccb0f3",
                                "sense_id": "943657a5-3347-372f-80a1-5a9e256f06b4",
                                "text": "Агибенин, начитанный истерик, лысый аристократ Красной Армии, отчаянно завидовал майору Кузякину."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29aa6000-8470-4162-bd11-1d817b7ec2f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e2ac80a-f607-33a0-9f78-4707a02e17ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "943657a5-3347-372f-80a1-5a9e256f06b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "hysterical man",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "77cb0bca-dd62-4a40-9b09-f2a12746d74f",
                        "source_entry_id": "8e2ac80a-f607-33a0-9f78-4707a02e17ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "943657a5-3347-372f-80a1-5a9e256f06b4",
                        "target_lang_word": "hysteric",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hysteric",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03291873-091d-3f29-83f6-efb2f750c319",
                                        "entry_id": "0d1fe53b-8d49-3243-995a-d37f703f76c6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hysterical; relating to hysteria."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f03ce640-375b-4012-8266-e4a3dd40a40f",
                                                "sense_id": "03291873-091d-3f29-83f6-efb2f750c319",
                                                "text": "Yes, my dravving-room is an abſolute regiſter-office for candidate actors, and poets vvithout character;—then to be continually alarmed vvith Miſſes and Ma'ams piping hiſteric changes on Juliets and Dorindas, Pollys and Ophelias; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da24cb61-ee18-4207-8e60-fcb9ed96670a",
                                                "sense_id": "03291873-091d-3f29-83f6-efb2f750c319",
                                                "text": "We also find gamblers of this type among some frigid hysteric women, who seem to treat gambling as they treat men, coldly and spongingly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "hysteric",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84641c0c-939a-3a91-a085-d28b1384357e",
                                        "entry_id": "6ebf7721-40a2-3aad-83d7-b8df3d018c8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hysterical person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c05abeda-8326-4e52-927c-1050c827211c",
                                                "sense_id": "84641c0c-939a-3a91-a085-d28b1384357e",
                                                "text": "“Which girl was it now?” he asks a second time. ¶ “Oh, you know, the hysteric,” Eleanor says, “the one who was parading her bazooms in your face.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
